    "name": "Clown Camp",
    "steam_appid": 3765700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e61199456b0748f9df3d11ee7f8ba584.avif?t=1748624834\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Summer of 1999. After years of begging, your parents have finally sent you off to your dream sleep-away camp on a picturesque lake. But a reckless game of Truth or Dare leads to you sneaking into the neighboring camp across the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A camp that is full of clowns. And they don\u2019t take too kindly to trespassers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e7cfbcdd0cee62f3540f2bcb5680784d.poster.avif?t=1748624834\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e7cfbcdd0cee62f3540f2bcb5680784d.webm?t=1748624834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e7cfbcdd0cee62f3540f2bcb5680784d.mp4?t=1748624834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/79c654e7f51beb1df2040b6e776f92c8.avif?t=1748624834\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run. Hide. Fight (<i>if you must</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until you can return to the safe side of the lake. Along the way, uncover the disturbing truth behind Clown Camp. Find environmental clues and postcards among the creaking cabins and pine trees. Carefully manage a small inventory that is essential to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/39cbcff38d20cdbd97557df49ef75f6d.avif?t=1748624834\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/ab5efc010745cf70da60ff9d24968519.avif?t=1748624834\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bask in the dithered glow of a design philosophy inspired by the days when surviving horror required both courage AND skill. Low poly 3D models, grainy filters, tight narrative, challenging gameplay, and puzzles take center stage once again. Additional modern quality of life features provide wider accessibility options on top of an intentionally retro base experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/bee81378825efdc97b329811653c1dc8.poster.avif?t=1748624834\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/bee81378825efdc97b329811653c1dc8.webm?t=1748624834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/bee81378825efdc97b329811653c1dc8.mp4?t=1748624834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e61199456b0748f9df3d11ee7f8ba584.avif?t=1748624834\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Summer of 1999. After years of begging, your parents have finally sent you off to your dream sleep-away camp on a picturesque lake. But a reckless game of Truth or Dare leads to you sneaking into the neighboring camp across the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A camp that is full of clowns. And they don\u2019t take too kindly to trespassers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e7cfbcdd0cee62f3540f2bcb5680784d.poster.avif?t=1748624834\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e7cfbcdd0cee62f3540f2bcb5680784d.webm?t=1748624834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e7cfbcdd0cee62f3540f2bcb5680784d.mp4?t=1748624834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/79c654e7f51beb1df2040b6e776f92c8.avif?t=1748624834\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run. Hide. Fight (<i>if you must</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until you can return to the safe side of the lake. Along the way, uncover the disturbing truth behind Clown Camp. Find environmental clues and postcards among the creaking cabins and pine trees. Carefully manage a small inventory that is essential to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/39cbcff38d20cdbd97557df49ef75f6d.avif?t=1748624834\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/ab5efc010745cf70da60ff9d24968519.avif?t=1748624834\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bask in the dithered glow of a design philosophy inspired by the days when surviving horror required both courage AND skill. Low poly 3D models, grainy filters, tight narrative, challenging gameplay, and puzzles take center stage once again. Additional modern quality of life features provide wider accessibility options on top of an intentionally retro base experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/bee81378825efdc97b329811653c1dc8.poster.avif?t=1748624834\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/bee81378825efdc97b329811653c1dc8.webm?t=1748624834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/bee81378825efdc97b329811653c1dc8.mp4?t=1748624834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "First-Person Survival Horror, 90\u2019s style. Hostile clowns lurk the woods. Fight-or-flight to uncover their gruesome secrets throughout a chilling Single-Player Story. Clever inventory management and resourcefulness are your only hopes to escape the Summer of 1999 alive.",
